<h2 id="remember-trigonometry">Remember Trigonometry?</h2>

<p>Next, let’s upgrade the motion from a boring straight line to something more “fire-like” :)</p>

<p>The feel of fire is that it flickers, so let’s make the particle move along a <strong>cosine wave</strong> path, with the amplitude gradually shrinking as the particle rises:</p>

