<h2 id="polishing-the-visuals">Polishing the Visuals</h2>

<p>The motion logic is done; now we need to polish the look to make the effect juicier.</p>

<p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Change the particle opacity during motion — modify the context’s opacity before the draw call:</p>

